  "title": "908 Devices to Participate in the Canaccord Genuity 46th Annual Growth Conference",
  "summary": "BURLINGTON, Mass.–(BUSINESS WIRE)– 908 Devices Inc. (Nasdaq: MASS), a core small-cap growth company focused on purpose-built handheld chemical analysis tools for vital health, safety and defense tech applications, announced it will participate in the upcoming Canaccord Genuity 46th Annual Growth Conference. 908 Devices’ management is scheduled to present on Wednesday, August 12 at 12:30 p.m. […]",
